# Third-party primary dataset is never committed, even though its license
# (CC BY 4.0) permits redistribution -- same repo-hygiene convention as the
# linear-a-constraint-validation project. Everything under data/ is fetched
# or generated locally and rebuilt from documented upstream sources with
# recorded checksums. See docs/DATA_PROVENANCE.md and data/README.md.
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/*
!data/README.md
!data/provenance.json

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
venv/
.venv/

